A||||5||Eric||Single outlet V6 exhaust||||3||
Z||000000||Eric||03-11-2000||01:48 PM||||Has anybody seen the new ramair Trans Ams with the single outlet exhaust?  The rear fascia looks like the Fieros with cutouts on each side for the tail pipes, but only one tip on the left side.  It doesn't look too bad, and I think it may solve the muffler problem for upgrading the V6's exaust.  You could get away with using a smaller (and cheaper) single inlet/outlet muffler and keep the pipe bends from being too sharp.  This could signficantly reduce costs of an upgrade because you wouldn't need mandrel bends to keep the flow up and there's only one exhaust tip to buy.  Hey, it might save a few pounds too!||||reg||3
Z||000001||1FST2M6||03-11-2000||11:31 PM||||Changing from my (what i thoughts was a nice muffler) Ocelot exhaust setup to a Single in single out 2.5" Flowmaster using 2.5" mandrel bent pipe and matching Random Technology cat I gaind nearly 14lbft of  torque! There is a reason Firehawk and the new SS-Z28s and MANY higher performance cars have the single outlet.. MORE TORQUE! High HP is nice but not really all that usefull unless your a REALLY expediant driver. Not so sure about the non-mandrel bent pipe though.. your under there... might as well do it right the first time instead of being disappointed and having to do it again... ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Eric||03-12-2000||12:07 PM||||So what kind of muffler are you using, Flowmaster p#?  They make some Delta Flow 13" units that I think would work well.  How does your system sound?  I wouldn't plan on using a cat, but you said in a previous post, it helps to build torque.  What kind of cost is involved with having someone weld up mandrel bends as opposed to standard bends.  I don't think the Fiero exhaust would be too hard for someone to replicate if he had the proper pipe bends already.  And to tell you the truth, I would drop the cradle if I was going to install a new exhaust.  No crawling under that thing for me when it only takes an hour or two to drop every thing you need out.||||reg||1
