Z||000005||Phil||03-12-2000||05:32 PM||||The ram air Trans Am is 3" pipe. Borla makes a system for the Trans Am that is exactly like the dia. above and it has baffle plates that go in the straight thru section with different size holes from total block off to wide open. A fella was in the speed shop fri. looking at this very thing.<p>[This message has been edited by Phil (edited 03-12-2000).]||||reg||1
